  "$comment": "Vendor values recorded in M0 (2026-11-09). auth-and-security.md §4 reads `oauth`; clients.md and `mema init` read `setup` and `tools`. Each entry names the ADR holding its evidence. Regexes are JavaScript source strings, anchored.",
